*.log
dist/
__pycache__/

# The Traefik binary the test environment downloads (tools/testenv).
tools/testenv/.cache/

# The screenshots of the review rounds. They are outputs of a run against
# the live system, and the live system is the installation: the zone, the
# host names and the live routes of the installation are in the pixels of
# the images. They do not belong in a repository that becomes public.
artifacts/

# The working material of the project: the memory of the board, the index
# of that memory, the brief the coordinator works from, and the per-task
# briefs and reports of herdr. They are the work of the project and not
# the product: the repository a reader finds is about the gatewarden and
# what it does. The files stay in the working copy, and the agents that
# work here read them there.
memory/
MEMORY.md
specs/tech-architecture/coordination-brief.md
.herdr-project/
